=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  bruteforce firewalld -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Rocky Linux$
# 10, firewalld running. firewalld has no rule like ufw's limit,$
# so the screen has no item and no line for one. The host's$
# limit is sshd's, the SSH Login screen's row (ssh-on). Drawn$
# from rows written in the gallery, which simulates no$
# firewalld.$
$
# Firewall Configuration #######################################$
$
  [+] Firewall             Configured firewalld running$
$
  firewalld ----------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Running              Yes$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
   -  Default zone         public$
   -  Active zones         public$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable firewalld    Stop firewalld (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

